Description: Ansible collection for the AbraFlexi ERP
 The vitexus.abraflexi collection manages records, attachments, labels,
 reports and web hooks of the AbraFlexi (FlexiBee) economic system through
 its REST API.
 .
 It also provides a lookup plugin, an inventory of companies and
 the abraflexi_server role, which installs the AbraFlexi server.
